Before you answer: divide each value by the one before it and check every answer is at least {{.MinStep}}. If one is not, drop that rung — a ladder with four honest rungs beats one with five where two of them look the same. Then check the rungs are smallest first, each has something a viewer can picture rather than a bare number, and the narration fields together contain {{.MinWords}}-{{.MaxWords}} words, targeting {{.TargetWords}}.
{{- end}}
